& [RunBoundary]
  + [CPRL-001] one executable uses only an unauthenticated loopback HTTP v1 endpoint
  + [CPRL-002] exactly one advertised model is selected either as the sole advertisement or by exact operator-supplied identifier
  + [CPRL-003] one strict CoordinationToolContext JSON file is opened into a fresh process-local compact registry before inference
  + [CPRL-004] registry context session sequence and record bindings remain host-owned and absent from model tool arguments

& [FirstPass]
  + [CPRL-005] tool name is exactly advance_attention_procedure
  + [CPRL-006] closed arguments contain only maximum_steps equal to the host-selected quota
  + [CPRL-007] tool choice is required parallel tool calls are false temperature is zero and thinking is disabled
  + [CPRL-008] first response must finish with exactly one tool call no public answer content and exact arguments

& [Subroutine]
  + [CPRL-009] accepted call maps to one CompactSessionCommand ADVANCE using the current hidden handle
  + [CPRL-010] the response must succeed and return a terminal handle for this one-call P0
  + [CPRL-011] the host READs the exact terminal record and validates its record and outcome digest through existing compact-session logic
  + [CPRL-012] any ready refused faulted corrupt or stale result stops before reflection

& [ReflectionPass]
  + [CPRL-013] the exact terminal handle and record JSON are supplied as the tool message in a separate provider request
  + [CPRL-014] no tool can be called in the reflection pass
  + [CPRL-015] final JSON must echo exact session_id outcome_digest observed_status and a fixed authority-bounded statement
  + [CPRL-016] provider-private reasoning fields are never written to the report

& [Boundary]
  + [CPRL-017] no llama.cpp modification hidden-state access mid-token insertion persistence authentication effect or semantic-truth claim is included
  + [CPRL-018] no automatic remote host EVO-X2 or OneDrive access is included
  + [CPRL-019] terminal record transport is deliberately exact and may be optimized only after measurement
  + [CPRL-020] live-model acceptance is separate from deterministic protocol and runtime acceptance

& [LocalProofUsability]
  + [CPRL-021] provider health accepts one successful loopback root response without requiring a provider-specific health path
  + [CPRL-022] an explicit model identifier must exactly equal one advertised model and unknown identifiers refuse
  + [CPRL-023] a fixture-context subcommand writes one create-new deterministic admitted context for local proof only
  + [CPRL-024] fixture output declares experimental provenance through its compiled identities and grants no SOP authority
  + [CPRL-025] fixture export performs no inference network access remote discovery or effect beyond the named local file

& [ReportReplay]
  + [CPRL-026] RunReport is a strict public machine form containing the complete sanitized successful trace and boundary declarations
  + [CPRL-027] verify rejects wrong profile status loopback URL model context digest session quota request call terminal record reflection or final identity
  + [CPRL-028] verify reconstructs the fresh one-session terminal registry and applies existing compact registry validation
  + [CPRL-029] verify deterministically rebuilds the reflection request from admitted first call prompt and terminal observation and requires exact equality
  + [CPRL-030] verify requires recursive absence of provider-private reasoning fields and the exact compiled nonclaim set
  + [CPRL-031] inspect emits a compact projection only after full verification
  + [CPRL-032] verify and inspect read only the named report and perform no provider request procedure execution effect remote access or historical context-path read

& [Acceptance]
  + [CPRL-A01] strict request call terminal projection reflection and final parsing fixtures pass
  + [CPRL-A02] wrong tool call count name quota content and final digest fail closed
  + [CPRL-A03] real compact-session fixture reaches the byte-identical core terminal outcome through the host binding
  + [CPRL-A04] loopback URL remote URL context and output boundaries are tested
  + [CPRL-A05] formatting warnings-denied lint full workspace regression manifest audit narrative and scoped Git review pass
  + [CPRL-A06] valid report replay and tampered profile request terminal digest final digest private field and nonclaim fixtures pass

